# Architecture Rules

- `domain/` — pure Kotlin, no Android imports
- Game logic: `GameEngine`; bots: `BotAI`; bot nicknames: `BotNames` (Hollywood + Russian classics, Russian strings)
- Offline human seat: `GameConfig.OFFLINE_HUMAN_DISPLAY_NAME` (`"Вы"`) + default avatar `0` — not online profile
- Online: `GameClient.login` / matchmaking / stream actions (Remote → gRPC); Local — no-op auth
- All game actions go through `GameClient` (`LocalGameClient` offline; `RemoteGameClient` online)
- ViewModels call `GameClient`, never `GameEngine` directly
- Online: `observeState()` / `observeRoom()` / `observeQuickMatch()` — push со stream; offline — tick/poll engine
- Actions: `login`, `playCard`, `addCard`, `pass`, `bito`, `ready`, `leaveSession` (Leave на сервер)
- DTOs in `data/api/dto/`; proto → DTO в `data/network/ProtoMappers`

```kotlin
// ✅ ViewModel
gameClient.playCard(sessionId, card, targetPairId)

// ❌ ViewModel
gameEngine.playCard(card)
```
